subtitle: >
  A Personal Computer Science Knowledge Base
  and Software Engineering Laboratory
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-01
url: "https://github.com/neivaeu/computer-science"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neivaeu/computer-science"
license: LicenseRef-AllRightsReserved
abstract: >
  A personal, living knowledge base and software engineering
  laboratory built by one person across 19 technological domains
  of computer science, organised across 21 root directories.
  Documents standalone system implementations, university
  coursework from 42 School, MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Oxford,
  ETH Zurich and EPFL, offensive security research and
  vulnerability PoCs from HackTheBox, HackerOne and PortSwigger,
  competitive programming algorithms, and independent concept
  laboratories. Not a course. Not a tutorial. A mind, organised.
keywords:
  - computer-science
  - software-engineering
  - offensive-security
  - algorithms
  - knowledge-base
  - systems-programming
  - vulnerability-research
  - competitive-programming
  - personal-laboratory
